Before the FIRST import of installed code, create a NEW runtime freeze and exact
raw source/fixture archives. Bind every installed core/oracle/test/runtime
dependency, original review-path helpers, six public sources, canonical/common,
own HAND216 raw JSONL and manifest, stripped legacy, runner and root-owned
