Each binding is `{sha256,bytes,archive}` at its actual ROOT-relative path.
The new runner verifies all exact raw archives before importing core tests and
again checks current bytes afterward. Preserve failed imports/tests/output and
first sources immutably; repairs require fresh source revisions and a new
